  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1602.22 \"Number 8 test blasting cap\" means a blasting cap containing 2 grams of a mixture of 80% mercury fulminate and 20% potassium chlorate, or a similar mixture of equivalent strength.\n\nSource. #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
